    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "frameworks",
      "lines": [
        "Written against: vue 3.5.43, 12 delivered packages.",
        "  Other delivered libraries: 27, axios 1.20.0, dompurify 3.4.16, @mdi/js 7.4.47, semver 7.8.5, @nextcloud/l10n 3.4.1, @nextcloud/router 3.2.0, and 21 more.",
        "  Packages and versions are those the .license files beside the chunks name, since the source maps miss packages through the toolchain defect named here."
